    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zhulu Chess is a strategic board game inspired by Go. You'll play as two protagonists during China's Northern and Southern Dynasties period, fighting for their respective kingdoms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core gameplay is a perfect information strategy board game where you'll freely choose your forces, solve puzzles, and defeat opponents. The game features a prediction system similar to &quot;Into the Breach&quot;, and you can challenge yourself with higher difficulties for a true feast of strategic thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will start with an initial commander and army, gather resources through battles, build a powerful force, and face the final Boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Perfect Information Board Game Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a battle begins, there are no random elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each battle, you'll select 10 pieces to deploy against your opponent. Infantry, cavalry, archers... each piece type possesses unique characteristics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The board will show the consequences of your next move, so there's no need for excessive thinking.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691890/extras/852e3af42ce4dda0012c96048b2d8dd1.poster.avif?t=1740105885\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691890/extras/852e3af42ce4dda0012c96048b2d8dd1.webm?t=1740105885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691890/extras/852e3af42ce4dda0012c96048b2d8dd1.mp4?t=1740105885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Instant Game-Changing Reversals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zhulu Chess incorporates mechanics from the traditional Chinese board game - <strong>Go</strong>. The game introduces the concept of &quot;Qi&quot; from Go instead of a health system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Qi = Piece's Defense - Incoming Attack Power</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can relieve the crisis of your pieces through offensive actions.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691890/extras/618ffee7e3d412d1c766c648cebe7784.poster.avif?t=1740105885\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691890/extras/618ffee7e3d412d1c766c648cebe7784.webm?t=1740105885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691890/extras/618ffee7e3d412d1c766c648cebe7784.mp4?t=1740105885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemy Intent</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a prediction system similar to &quot;Into the Breach&quot;, revealing enemy actions for the next turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691890/extras/e7c1c67e0b2f0018630316ce6f75206b.poster.avif?t=1740105885\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691890/extras/e7c1c67e0b2f0018630316ce6f75206b.webm?t=1740105885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691890/extras/e7c1c67e0b2f0018630316ce6f75206b.mp4?t=1740105885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hardcore Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True difficulty isn't just about increasing numbers.<br>In Challenge Mode, you can no longer predict enemy intentions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, think and decide like a master player facing AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Regret for Free</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Except at the very beginning, you can undo moves at any time and restart the match. Therefore, don't be afraid to try anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691890/extras/20052173aaf9b2127483ff77e7c6d511.poster.avif?t=1740105885\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691890/extras/20052173aaf9b2127483ff77e7c6d511.webm?t=1740105885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691890/extras/20052173aaf9b2127483ff77e7c6d511.mp4?t=1740105885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dual Narrative</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as generals from both the North and South, struggling through the inevitable course of history, and ultimately, you must determine a victor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zhulu Chess is a strategic board game inspired by Go. You'll play as two protagonists during China's Northern and Southern Dynasties period, fighting for their respective kingdoms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core gameplay is a perfect information strategy board game where you'll freely choose your forces, solve puzzles, and defeat opponents. The game features a prediction system similar to &quot;Into the Breach&quot;, and you can challenge yourself with higher difficulties for a true feast of strategic thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will start with an initial commander and army, gather resources through battles, build a powerful force, and face the final Boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Perfect Information Board Game Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a battle begins, there are no random elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each battle, you'll select 10 pieces to deploy against your opponent. Infantry, cavalry, archers... each piece type possesses unique characteristics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The board will show the consequences of your next move, so there's no need for excessive thinking.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691890/extras/852e3af42ce4dda0012c96048b2d8dd1.poster.avif?t=1740105885\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691890/extras/852e3af42ce4dda0012c96048b2d8dd1.webm?t=1740105885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691890/extras/852e3af42ce4dda0012c96048b2d8dd1.mp4?t=1740105885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Instant Game-Changing Reversals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zhulu Chess incorporates mechanics from the traditional Chinese board game - <strong>Go</strong>. The game introduces the concept of &quot;Qi&quot; from Go instead of a health system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Qi = Piece's Defense - Incoming Attack Power</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can relieve the crisis of your pieces through offensive actions.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691890/extras/618ffee7e3d412d1c766c648cebe7784.poster.avif?t=1740105885\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691890/extras/618ffee7e3d412d1c766c648cebe7784.webm?t=1740105885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691890/extras/618ffee7e3d412d1c766c648cebe7784.mp4?t=1740105885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemy Intent</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a prediction system similar to &quot;Into the Breach&quot;, revealing enemy actions for the next turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691890/extras/e7c1c67e0b2f0018630316ce6f75206b.poster.avif?t=1740105885\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691890/extras/e7c1c67e0b2f0018630316ce6f75206b.webm?t=1740105885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691890/extras/e7c1c67e0b2f0018630316ce6f75206b.mp4?t=1740105885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hardcore Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True difficulty isn't just about increasing numbers.<br>In Challenge Mode, you can no longer predict enemy intentions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, think and decide like a master player facing AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Regret for Free</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Except at the very beginning, you can undo moves at any time and restart the match. Therefore, don't be afraid to try anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691890/extras/20052173aaf9b2127483ff77e7c6d511.poster.avif?t=1740105885\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691890/extras/20052173aaf9b2127483ff77e7c6d511.webm?t=1740105885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691890/extras/20052173aaf9b2127483ff77e7c6d511.mp4?t=1740105885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dual Narrative</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as generals from both the North and South, struggling through the inevitable course of history, and ultimately, you must determine a victor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Zhulu Chess is a strategic board game inspired by Go, set in an era of turbulent warfare. With a prediction system like &quot;Into the Breach&quot;, this perfect information game challenges you to solve tactical puzzles, and outmaneuver opponents. Test your strategy across multiple difficulty levels.",
